      "content": "[{\"base\":{\"ref\":\"main\",\"repo\":{\"description\":\"Personal Website Reumse\",\"full_name\":\"sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan\"},\"sha\":\"7de35b750d701ef002e7afa8c7678e68ad40b0c0\"},\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nComprehensive SEO improvements based on deep analysis of 15 competitor portfolio websites including Brittany Chiang, Will Boyd (codersblock.com), Gift Egwuenu, Olaolu Olawuyi, and others.\\n\\n### Key Changes:\\n\\n- **Title Tag Optimization**: Updated to 57 chars with keywords (React, AI/ML, San Francisco)\\n- **RSS Feed**: New `/rss.xml` route for content syndication\\n- **Skip-to-Content Link**: Accessibility improvement matching top competitors\\n- **SiteNavigationElement Schema**: Better site structure for Google\\n- **Person Schema Enhancement**: Added workLocation for local SEO\\n- **Homepage Content Expansion**: Added H2 headers, expanded to ~400 words\\n- **Popular Posts Section**: Added to blog page with scoring algorithm\\n- **robots.txt Updates**: Added more AI crawlers (ChatGPT-User, Claude-Web, cohere-ai, anthropic-ai)\\n- **llms.txt Updates**: RSS feed reference and consistent messaging\\n- **Google Search Console**: Verification placeholder added\\n\\n### Files Changed:\\n- `app/layout.tsx` - Title, schemas, skip link, RSS link\\n- `app/blog/page.tsx` - Popular posts section\\n- `app/page.tsx` - Main content ID for skip link\\n- `app/rss.xml/route.ts` - **NEW** RSS feed\\n- `components/intro-section.tsx` - Expanded content with H2 headers\\n- `lib/blog.ts` - `getPopularPosts()` function\\n- `public/robots.txt` - AI crawler additions\\n- `public/llms.txt` &amp; `public/llms-full.txt` - Updates\\n- `research/competitor-seo.md` - **NEW** Full competitor analysis\\n\\n## Test Plan\\n\\n- [ ] Verify homepage loads with new content structure\\n- [ ] Check `/rss.xml` generates valid RSS feed\\n- [ ] Verify skip-to-content link works on focus\\n- [ ] Test blog page shows Popular Posts section\\n- [ ] Validate structured data with Google Rich Results Test\\n- [ ] Check robots.txt is accessible\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-16T02:23:36Z\",\"draft\":false,\"head\":{\"ref\":\"competitor-seo\",\"repo\":{\"description\":\"Personal Website Reumse\",\"full_name\":\"sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan\"},\"sha\":\"7ef5577f2fd8d8f7bc3bed73b9faf1198d8132e1\"},\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan/pull/1\",\"merged\":false,\"number\":1,\"state\":\"open\",\"title\":\"feat: Comprehensive SEO improvements based on competitor analysis\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-16T02:23:40Z\",\"user\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101021315?v=4\",\"id\":101021315,\"login\":\"sameerkhansf\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/sameerkhansf\"}}]"
