 Rich Results Test\\n- [ ] Check robots.txt is accessible\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-16T02:23:36Z\",\"draft\":false,\"head\":{\"ref\":\"competitor-seo\",\"repo\":{\"description\":\"Personal Website Reumse\",\"full_name\":\"sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan\"},\"sha\":\"7ef5577f2fd8d8f7bc3bed73b9faf1198d8132e1\"},\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan/pull/1\",\"merged\":false,\"number\":1,\"state\":\"open\",\"title\":\"feat: Comprehensive SEO improvements based on competitor analysis\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-16T02:23:40Z\",\"user\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101021315?v=4\",\"id\":101021315,\"login\":\"sameerkhansf\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/sameerkhansf\"}}]"
